81	/// Builds the guardian user content items from:
82	/// - a compact transcript for authorization and local context
83	/// - the exact action JSON being proposed for approval
84	///
85	/// The fixed guardian policy lives in the review session developer message.
86	/// Split the variable request into separate user content items so the
87	/// Responses request snapshot shows clear boundaries while preserving exact
88	/// prompt text through trailing newlines.
